<title>USA: Orange National Bancorp raises dividend.</title>
<headline>Orange National Bancorp raises dividend.</headline>
<dateline>ORANGE, Calif. 1997-07-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Orange National Bancorp said Friday it increased its quarterly dividend to $0.10 per share from $0.085.</p>
<p>The new dividend is payable September 2 to shareholders of record August 14.</p>
</text>
